identity just because you have used it before. 

Here, let's try an example. Suppose I start posting as Seth Washinsky
<seth@panix.com>.  I post for a year using that address. Nobody says
anything about it. Everyone claims they know me. Then the real Seth
Washinsky shows up. He is outraged. He posts as Seth Washinsky
