that question: the reply I posted is forged. It is forged, and all the
articles I posted during the year are forged. All of them. The only
article that isn't forged is the one the real Seth posted. It doesn't
matter in the slightest that YOU are used to seeing ME post with that
identity. It isn't mine in the first place, so anything I post is a
forgery. 

