"real world". During the year that I post as Seth, I make it well known
that I grow drugs in my backyard, that I got AIDS either from injecting
heroin with a dirty needle or sex with 83 other men I don't know which,
that I haven't paid taxes on any of the money I made from selling
drugs, and that I intend on shooting someone who it is a crime just to
make that sort of statement about.

